[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7623.75, "timestamp": "02:07:03", "text": "你也不一定非要那样做。   还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7626.149, "timestamp": "02:07:06", "text": "什么呢？  [倒吸一口凉气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7630.709, "timestamp": "02:07:10", "text": "嗯，所以，以防你忘记。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7633.189, "timestamp": "02:07:13", "text": "我进度落后了吗？ 好吧，我刚才网络延迟了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7635.27, "timestamp": "02:07:15", "text": "如果您忘记了要更改哪些设置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7637.83, "timestamp": "02:07:17", "text": "、要执行哪些设置等等，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7641.189, "timestamp": "02:07:21", "text": "已经请求添加一个插件功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7644.79, "timestamp": "02:07:24", "text": "所以，它被称为默认源"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7648.069, "timestamp": "02:07:28", "text": "默认值。 直接谷歌一下就行了。 未设置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.589, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "纹理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7659.99, "timestamp": "02:07:39", "text": "呃，稍等片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7662.629, "timestamp": "02:07:42", "text": "是的，OBS 里有个叫做“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7665.03, "timestamp": "02:07:45", "text": "source default”的插件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7667.03, "timestamp": "02:07:47", "text": "所以，这样做的好处是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.51, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "你可以设置父级来源"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7672.95, "timestamp": "02:07:52", "text": "等等。 哦，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.43, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "添加了一个新的更新。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7678.95, "timestamp": "02:07:58", "text": "我建议过一个旧版本，就像我之前建议的那样，感谢"}]